                                text="&lt;p>At AbbVie, we believe the paths we take to achieve breakthroughs matter just as much as the impact they have. We foster a culture of curiosity – asking questions, exploring possibilities and finding new solutions that make lives better&amp;nbsp; – for patients, people, communities and our world.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;At the heart of our innovation are our people from different nationalities and backgrounds. Their diverse experiences and perspectives help us explore new ways of thinking and reflect the voices of patients and customers we serve globally.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
